      "writtenOn": "2018-03-14T07:00:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do you need to put dome switch level in system state? Can\u0027t you just keep the value locally in this function?",
      "revId": "516f69007600af09c92e3edc25b855df5c769ba8",
