      "lineNbr": 122,
      "author": {
        "id": 1136349
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-03-22T11:14:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because this has to be reset after touchpad update.\n\nST firmware only report switch state changes.\nSo if the switch is on before touchpad update, we won\u0027t received a switch off event until user clicks on the touchpad.",
